{"root":"campur","ipa":"/ˈtʃampur/","core":"混合、掺杂、混杂","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ˈtʃampur/","zh":"混合，掺杂，混在一起","phrases":[{"t":"campur aduk","zh":"混杂在一起，五味杂陈"},{"t":"nasi campur","zh":"杂菜饭，什锦饭"},{"t":"air campur","zh":"混合水"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jangan campur urusan pribadi dengan urusan kantor.","zh":"不要把私事和公事混为一谈。"},{"t":"Minyak dan air tidak bisa campur.","zh":"油和水是无法混合的。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"campur","ipa":"/ˈtʃampur/","zh":"混合，掺杂","phrase":{"t":"campur tangan","zh":"插手，干涉"},"example":{"t":"Mereka suka campur urusan orang lain.","zh":"他们喜欢插手别人的事情。"}},{"w":"mencampur","ipa":"/mənˈtʃampur/","zh":"把...混合，掺入","phrase":{"t":"mencampur gula","zh":"加入糖"},"example":{"t":"Dia mencampur susu dengan kopi.","zh":"他把牛奶和咖啡混在一起。"}},{"w":"mencampurkan","ipa":"/mənˈtʃampur.kan/","zh":"把...掺和进...里","phrase":{"t":"mencampurkan bahan","zh":"混合材料"},"example":{"t":"Ibu mencampurkan tepung ke dalam adonan.","zh":"母亲把面粉掺进面团里。"}},{"w":"tercampur","ipa":"/tərˈtʃampur/","zh":"被混合，不小心掺入","phrase":{"t":"tercampur aduk","zh":"混杂在一起的"},"example":{"t":"Uang saya tercampur dengan uangnya.","zh":"我的钱和他的钱混在一起了。"}},{"w":"campuran","ipa":"/tʃamˈpuran/","zh":"混合物，杂合体","phrase":{"t":"bahan campuran","zh":"混合材料"},"example":{"t":"Minuman ini adalah campuran jus buah dan susu.","zh":"这种饮料是果汁和牛奶的混合物。"}},{"w":"percampuran","ipa":"/pər.tʃamˈpuran/","zh":"混合过程，交融","phrase":{"t":"percampuran budaya","zh":"文化交融"},"example":{"t":"Percampuran ras dapat dilihat di kota ini.","zh":"在这个城市可以看到种族的融合。"}}],"derSlugs":["campur","mencampur","mencampurkan","tercampur","campuran","percampuran"],"model":"gemini-3.5-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T02:20:09.960Z","src":"base"}